            %p
          #ReferencesForNonabelianCrossedHomomorphisms.num_remark
            %h6 Remark
            %p
              Def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#CrossedHomomorphism"}
              appears, already with the non-abelian generality in mind, back in
              %a{:href => "#Whitehead49"} Whitehead 1949, (3.1)
              (together with the notion of
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/crossed+modules"} crossed modules
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+types"} homotopy types
              with non-trivial
              = succeed ")." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fundamental+group"} fundamental group
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/abelian+group"} abelian
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi Γ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Gamma
              the definition is in
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "#EilenbergMacLane47"} Eilenberg &amp; MacLane (1947) §3.1
              %a{:href => "#MacLane75"} MacLane (1975) IV (2.1)
              and many following references on
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/group+cohomology"} group cohomology
              = succeed "." do
                %a{:href => "#Brown82"} Brown 1982, p. 45
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/non-abelian+group"} non-abelian
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi Γ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Gamma
              the notion is later used in
              %a{:href => "#MurayamaShimakawa95"} Murayama &amp; Shimakawa 1995
              for discussion of
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+principal+bundles"} equivariant principal bundles
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/nonabelian+group+cohomology"} nonabelian group cohomology
              it is reviewed in
              = succeed "." do
